Snapshot a quiescent run and optional report/export directories

Usage: crypto dataset custody create [OPTIONS] --out <OUT> --bundle <BUNDLE>

Options:
      --color <COLOR>
          Color output mode: `auto` (default), `always`, or `never`. `auto` enables colors only on TTY.  Respected by every visual renderer [default: auto]
      --out <OUT>
          
      --sat-replay-policy <SAT_REPLAY_POLICY>
          Independently authorized finite historical SAT replay allowance
      --bundle <BUNDLE>
          
      --sat-replay-receipt <SAT_REPLAY_RECEIPT>
          
      --include <INCLUDES>
          Extra directory in the form LABEL=PATH; appears under extra/LABEL
      --max-bytes <MAX_BYTES>
          [default: 1099511627776]
      --max-files <MAX_FILES>
          [default: 1000000]
  -h, --help
          Print help
